<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia total vehicle sales up 32.9 pct in Aug.</title>
<headline>Malaysia total vehicle sales up 32.9 pct in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total vehicle sales in Malaysia rose 32.9 percent year-on-year in August to 33,581 units from 25,251, the Malaysian Motor Traders' Association (MMTA) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Sales of passenger cars, including four-wheel drive vehicles, went up 29.6 percent to 26,134 units in August 1996 from 20,168 units a year ago, the group said in a statement.</p>
</text>
